From: Chaos Ruler <zmelumian@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: chipone-icna35xx: enable AYN Ultra Black on ICNA3520

Send the enhance_color "on" sequence (9F/B7/B8) that AYN Android uses
for the Thor top panel. Bytes from the Android DT
qcom,mdss-dsi-enhance-color-command. Local test, not upstream.
---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c	2026-10-07 20:27:02.193591477 +0300
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c	2026-10-07 20:27:02.200766882 +0300
@@ -200,6 +200,17 @@
 
 	mipi_dsi_dcs_set_display_on_multi(&dsi_ctx);
 
+	/*
+	 * AYN "OLED Ultra Black" (enhance_color on): reduces colour shift and
+	 * mura at low brightness. Same DCS long writes Android sends at 60/120 Hz.
+	 */
+	mipi_dsi_dcs_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0x9F, 0x00);
+	mipi_dsi_dcs_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xB7, 0x00, 0x11, 0x11, 0x00, 0x55,
+				     0x55, 0x55, 0x55, 0x55, 0x55, 0x55, 0x55,
+				     0x55, 0x40, 0x40, 0x40, 0x15, 0x00);
+	mipi_dsi_dcs_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, 0xB8, 0x00, 0x00, 0x02, 0x41, 0x17,
+				     0x02, 0x28, 0x17, 0x00);
+
 	return dsi_ctx.accum_err;
 }
 
